{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, sorry, I kinda want a little time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, me too, if possible..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Riding on </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s lead, I raised my hand too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
