{MESON "500"}
"Then let's start in 5 minutes."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had her arms folded, groaning, "Hmmm, hmmm."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was fiddling with her phone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">She was probably searching for ghost-story material.</STYLE><PG>
Obaasan<STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> showed no sign of hesitating.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe they were used to Arata's rules; it looked like they had prepared their stories in advance.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"I'm gonna hit the bathroom while I can!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah! Wait, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! I'm coming too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Ooh, what's this? </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you're scared to go to the bathroom alone?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"As if!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Zat so, zat so! Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you go first."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? We're not going together...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"There's no need to go pee together. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Just be honest and say it: 'Kana-sama, I'm scared, so please come with me.'"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ngh...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hmph! I was just gonna go to be on the safe side, so I don't even need to go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm, well, don't blame me if you wet yourself!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> looked a little disgruntled, but she headed for the bathroom alone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, um, I'll go to the bathroom too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you need the bathroom too, right? Let's go together."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　R-right!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It's at times like this that I have to lend a hand.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">―That said...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家玄関暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"H-hey, we can't turn the lights on...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"We already turned off the living room lights... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That means no making it bright till the contest's over, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Walking through an old mansion deep in the mountains without a light is very, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">ve-e-ery </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おもむき">atmospheric</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So atmospheric that beings who cannot exist may be </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ひ">drawn</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> here as well... perhaps.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\新村本家トイレ暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Where we arrived was the washroom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Go through this washroom and there's the toilet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"This is the toilet...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, this is the toilet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see, so this is the toilet..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">The toilet―.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It is a delicate place where one relieves oneself, and at the same time, a space where one is promised solitude.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It is also a space that sometimes gives peace, and sometimes gives unease.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The washroom and the toilet door were modern, perhaps recently renovated, but that only brought a creepy Western-style mansion to mind.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you done yet?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hold on! It's being really stubborn!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Crap..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Saying 'crap' in front of the toilet is so crude, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Not that kind of crap!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Even a crude conversation with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> brought a little relief to the wooden house in the dark of night.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">At first I had come along for </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s sake, but I was starting to be overwhelmed by the creepiness too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">For example, if something were to happen here―.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Yes, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, who should have been in the toilet, suddenly vanishing.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, you done yet? If we take too long, </STYLE>Grandma<STYLE ID="1">'s gonna get mad at us."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Can you hear me!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is in there, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
