{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, obviously! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">She's... supposed to be..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, you're really in there, right? I'm opening it, okay?"</STYLE>
