{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Well, looks like everyone's warmed up nicely, so shall we get started?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, are you okay...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Man, it's, like... I didn't even get time to think up a story..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Same... Nothing can scare me now..."</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "229" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
"Well then, I'll draw. Who'll be first..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The paper dolls lay face down in front of </STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">She chose the one at the far right end.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ろうそく.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hmm... I see..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Obaasan<STYLE ID="3"> set the doll she had drawn in the middle of the table.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ろうそくフィルター.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\怪談テーブル.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\紙人形\紙人形五島エリカ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "550" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n120\r\n2000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n120\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<BR>
Erika Goto
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
"Me, right off the bat."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Obaasan<STYLE ID="3"> apparently still thought she was </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ろうそくの明かり.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I was originally from outside. I moved here when I married in. 
{PAUSE ""}
As you know, the Arata settlement is an insular place. 
{PAUSE ""}
So a bride coming here is welcomed, but on the other hand, she's tested on whether she's fit for it."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE>Mother<STYLE ID="6">, that story..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's fine. Things like this ought to start with me, the head of the settlement."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Judging by </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s manner, it seemed </STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="3">'s story might be something that must not be told to outsiders.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1,人物1,人物2,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―That was about 50 years ago now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\共有殺人.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\大魔女手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">When I first came here, the previous Grand Witch greeted me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">The test, which </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> went through too, is to survive in the mountains for a year without help from anyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In the Arata settlement, this is called the </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="さんろう">mountain seclusion</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\戦.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">As for why we do such a thing: the Arata settlement was originally a gathering of outcasts.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">800 years ago, people fleeing from war moved to this remote land of Arata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That was the beginning of the Arata settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The residents have been trained for generations so they can live on their own strength.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">So anyone who wishes to marry in is given that ordeal as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Plenty of women can't bear an ordeal like that and run away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But endure it to the end, and she's recognized as truly meaning to become one of Arata, and a woman who married in is given a higher standing than the men.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Well, everyone from Arata knows that much.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\鉈とハンマー.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">But... back when I married in, there was one more... troublesome ordeal.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was to kill a person who threatened Arata's existence.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Arata was a gathering of people who had run away, to begin with.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Long ago, they say, plenty of men in power came to attack this place.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So to stand against them, we needed to learn the art of killing people too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Around the time I took that ordeal, an official from the prefecture was due to come here for a survey.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Apparently, he was plotting a land grab on Arata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The ordeal given to me was to kill that official and destroy the evidence.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The deadline was one week. Any method would do.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I agonized over it. Not only killing a person, but destroying the evidence too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That's a different thing from hunting beasts in the mountains.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If I did a half-baked job, the settlement itself would cease to exist.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But I wanted to be with my husband, no matter what.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\県庁.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I made up my mind and headed for the Iizawa prefectural capital, 2 hours from here by car.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">All I had with me then was one nata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="さんろう">mountain seclusion</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had toughened my body, but could I really do it...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">At night, in front of the prefectural office, I lay in wait, sitting still in the car.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">―About 3 hours must have passed. The target appeared, alone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If I charged him now with the nata raised, I could be with my husband.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But I couldn't work up the courage.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Killing a person to be with my husband.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Was that really the happiness I wanted?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But I had no other choice...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I got out of the car with the nata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Luckily, the target was on foot, so I followed him on foot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A place with as few passersby as possible.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Until he moved to one, I stayed quietly on the target's trail.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\県庁夜道.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―Eventually, the target turned into the perfect alley.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">No one passing by, and just one streetlight.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But even if I killed him, I mustn't leave any evidence.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In that case, should I make it look like the work of a robber?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Then, a method that kept the crime as short as possible―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">better to take the wallet before killing him than to rummage for it on the corpse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Better still if the target handed over his wallet without my threatening him.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I was barely 20 at the time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If a young girl said she'd dropped her wallet and had no train fare, wouldn't he give her a little money?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If I swung the nata the moment he took out his wallet, I could get away at once.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I decided to go with this plan.</STYLE><PG>
"Um, excuse me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I hid the nata behind my back and called out, and the target turned around.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That was the first time I saw the target's face up close.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">He was a smiling, kind-looking old man, as if goodness itself had taken shape.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What's the matter?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah... 
{PAUSE ""}
Um... my wallet... I lost it... and I can't get home... 
{PAUSE ""}
Train fare..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then, without hesitating, the target took his wallet out of his breast pocket.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I meant to strike at that moment, but his gentle face threw me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"A young lady mustn't go walking about alone at this time of night. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Here, take a taxi with this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">What the target handed me was two 1,000-yen bills.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">2,000 yen back then would probably be worth about 5,000 yen today.</STYLE><PG>
"Wait, please! Such a large sum...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Not at all. May God bless </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Without even hearing my thanks, the target turned his back and started walking again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">What am I hesitating for...! I have a dream, to be with my husband!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">For that dream, you have to...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">It no longer mattered whether it looked like a robbery.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I raised the nata and was about to fall upon the man.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That was when it happened.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Grandpa!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I heard a small boy's voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, Cha-bo! Did you come to meet me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The target scooped up the small boy who had run to him.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And beyond them, a woman who looked to be the boy's mother.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Seeing that, I couldn't move, as if my feet had taken root.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">To destroy his happiness and―that small boy's, just so I could be happy...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And not only that. How many people had that man saved?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">He even bestowed his kindness on a total stranger like me.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">I made up my mind and ran up behind the target.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
"Um...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I hid the nata behind my back again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I found my wallet! I'll give this back to you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">I held out the two 1,000-yen bills he had given me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The target turned back toward me, still holding the boy.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, is that so? I'm glad to hear it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But I've already given that to </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's not it...! The truth is, I never lost my wallet at all―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I said that, the target's voice became even gentler.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"In that case, when someone truly in need appears before </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, please give this to them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Taken by an honest person like </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="3">, these 2,000 yen must be content too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Well, then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I couldn't say a word back, couldn't move my feet...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">All I could do was watch the target go until he was out of sight.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\県庁.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―I stayed in the car like that, crying until morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There was no way I could go back now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">As an </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="わ">apology</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> to my husband and the previous Grand Witch, I thought of dying alone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But before that, I had to report.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In the morning sun, I went back to the Arata settlement.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\荒田集落イメージ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The moment I reached the Arata settlement, a crowd of residents surrounded me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I thought I was being blamed for failing the ordeal.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But everyone was smiling.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">―Well done.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">―You did your best.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That's what they said to me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">According to them, the news had reported that the target was dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">'Hacked to pieces with a large blade like a nata,' it said.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\大魔女手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I decided to confess honestly to the previous Grand Witch.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">No, I wasn't the one who did this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Someone else just happened to kill that man.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I got down on my knees and bowed, apologizing for my own failure.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But the previous Grand Witch said this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see. To hide the fact that you killed him even from me... </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="3"> are very good at keeping a secret. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That is as it should be. You have passed the ordeal splendidly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"N-no! I'm not the one who killed―"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"It is fine, that way. The one who knows you killed him is </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="3"> alone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I will keep this a secret as well."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">is what she said.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then who on earth killed him?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The clue was 'a large blade like a nata.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">That was when I realized.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Someone in this settlement had meant to kill him from the start.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Whether I killed him or not, it didn't matter either way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Making me share the settlement's secret.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Keeping it to the end, that was the real ordeal.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ろうそくの明かり.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Of course, there's no such ordeal now. 
{PAUSE ""}
But it does exist. Somewhere in this Arata, the fear and the will to fight that remove anyone who threatens it. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's the end of my story."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Everyone's faces looked solemn rather than frightened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was a strange story rather than a ghost story.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="2">, is this story true?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, it's only a ghost story, after all. I'll leave that to your imagination. 
{PAUSE ""}
Now, next."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">With that, </STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="3"> chose the doll at the left end.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It seemed </STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="3">'s ghost story really ended with just that.</STYLE><PG>
